Propose OpenSLO-shaped SLO candidates from Grafana signals.

## Inputs

- `openslo_catalog`, `catalog_gaps`, `grafana_slo_signals`

## Rules

- Skip names already in catalog unless workflow input `allow_slo_overwrite=true`.
- Cap proposals at **${max_proposals}** per run.
- Default availability target: **${default_availability_target}**
- Default latency threshold: **${default_latency_threshold_ms}** ms

Emit **`slo_proposals`** JSON with good/total PromQL, service, signal_type, proposed_path under `openslo/slos/<service>/<name>.yaml`.
